==Description==
The '''KorbloxHunter Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained by beating [[Korblox Temple]] on Mega difficulty.

The nametag features a gradient of black and deep blue for the text, accented by a glowing blue runic loop. This loop is accompanied by floating symbols and particles that partially overlap and obscure the text. A blue aura also emits from the player.

==Trivia==
*Despite the description stating it was a reward for triumphing [[The Hunt: Mega Edition Event]] in Hard Mode, the required difficulty that needed to be beaten was actually Mega, not Hard.
**Due to there not even being a mode named "Hard", it likely means the Mega mode was named Hard before being renamed to Mega.

